{"id": "2026-11-02-openai-pando", "event_date": "2026-11-02", "title": "OpenAI 公开 Git 兼容后端 Pando，monorepo 推送中位延迟降近 5 倍", "summary": "OpenAI 介绍自研 Git 兼容后端 Pando：按分支独立协调写入（因果一致性），packfile 存于 blob 存储并跨客户端复用，经区域缓存分发；已承载 OpenAI 全部 monorepo 开发，日均输出近 1 PB Git 数据。暂未对外提供。", "tech_category": "eng-practice", "orgs": ["OpenAI"], "date_basis": "official_local", "status": "announced", "sources": [{"url": "https://openai.com/index/scaling-git-at-openai/", "publisher": "OpenAI", "type": "official"}, {"url": "https://thenewstack.io/openai-pando-git-backend/", "publisher": "The New Stack", "type": "media"}], "created_at": "2026-11-04T17:25:00+08:00", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T23:14:59+08:00", "impact": "B", "impact_reason": "工程博客，内部系统未开放，性能为公司自述；按不确定取 B", "verified": "official", "region": "US"}
