{"id": "2026-11-03-apple-siri-ai-app-intents", "event_date": "2026-11-03", "title": "苹果经 App Intents 向所有开发者开放 Siri AI（开发者预览）", "summary": "随 iOS/iPadOS/macOS/visionOS 27.3 beta，苹果推出开发者预览：任何 App 可通过 App Intents 将内容与操作接入 Siri AI，并新增 skills 组合多步操作、Spotlight 语义索引任意实体；数月后面向用户，App Store 提交春季开放。", "tech_category": "platform", "orgs": ["Apple"], "date_basis": "official_local", "status": "preview", "sources": [{"url": "https://developer.apple.com/news/?id=gdk2umrf", "publisher": "Apple Developer", "type": "official"}, {"url": "https://www.theverge.com/tech/1025694/apple-siri-ai-third-party-apps", "publisher": "The Verge", "type": "media"}], "note": "核实 2026-11-04：iOS/iPadOS/macOS/visionOS 27.3 beta 开发者预览，App Store 提交春季开放；EU 暂不可用", "created_at": "2026-11-04T17:25:00+08:00", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T23:14:59+08:00", "impact": "A", "impact_reason": "S 候选（覆盖全部 Apple 开发者的系统级 AI 入口），但仅 beta/开发者预览、正式上线在数月后，按规则封顶 A", "verified": "official", "region": "US"}
